==============================================================================
  DEMO D1: Naive fix (only the key is derived; signature is a free choice)
==============================================================================
  Thief forgeries accepted : 1000/1000  (100%)
  Example thief commitment : bfe8165fe814df487932911cb451e940...  (made 2026-10-04T19:46:26+00:00, after the theft)
  -> Only timestamp ordering separates owner from thief. A theft before the owner
